        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n9. The Act, 2006 was enacted with an object to consolidate the laws relating to food and to establish the Food Safety and Standards Authority of India for laying down science based standards for articles of food and to regulate their manuf"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cacfe928f9a849f88610114c6f4a21f7_21",
