          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nPage No.# 1/6 vs The State Of Assam on 9 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/179026814/"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9d03191b8ce344ce8a94fbb8eba22102_35",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "3 15. Accordingly, the present criminal revision petition stands allowed by interfering with the sentence of Simple Imprisonment for 6 (six) months Page No.# 6/6 each and it is directed that the sentence be confined to the fine already dire"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3255289e9bd3404299cc633e98cad21a_36",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
